---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import jake from '../../assets/home/jake-portrait.jpg';
---
<section class="bg-gls-paper px-4 py-16">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <div class="text-center">
      <p class="font-heading text-xl text-gls-ink/70">is <em>this</em> the</p>
      <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl font-bold sm:text-5xl">status quo?</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow">
        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold">for business leaders...</h3>
        <p class="mt-3">
          You're spending on marketing but you can't tell what it's actually doing for the business.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">And you're not sure if the problem is the strategy, the team, or both.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow">
        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold">for marketing leaders...</h3>
        <p class="mt-3">
          You know what needs doing but you're buried in requests from sales and leadership.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          So instead of driving marketing forward, you're running a service desk for other departments.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto mt-20 grid max-w-5xl items-center gap-10 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">I'm Jake. I've been there.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">
        After years of managing marketing strategies and teams, I kept running into
        <strong>the same two problems</strong>:
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
        <li>Nobody knows if marketing is working</li>
        <li>The <strong>to-do list never gets shorter</strong></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-4">
        So we help you build a <strong>practical plan</strong> that is grounded in what the
        <strong>business actually needs</strong> and <strong>achievable</strong> with the resources you have.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4">
        Then <strong>we work alongside your team</strong> to clear the backlog, manage ongoing work, and give
        <strong>you the capacity to lead</strong> marketing instead of just keeping up with it.
      </p>
      <a
        href="#contact-2026"
        class="mt-8 inline-block rounded-md bg-gradient-to-r from-gls-green to-gls-yellow px-8 py-3 font-heading font-bold text-white shadow transition hover:opacity-90"
      >
        Let's Chat
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="text-center">
      <Image
        src={jake}
        alt="Jake Mooney, founder of Green Light Studio"
        width={600}
        height={600}
        class="mx-auto aspect-square w-full max-w-[600px] rounded-2xl object-cover object-right shadow-lg"
      />
      <p class="mt-4 font-heading font-bold">Jake Mooney</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-gls-ink/70">Founder &middot; Green Light Studio</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
